    "summary": "Errata rewriting [Summoned by Slaughter](vsdata:ability/world-eaters.khorne-daemonkin.summoned-by-slaughter). Use it in any phase, when a unit's last model is **destroyed** and before it is removed; a **TRANSPORT** unit's embarked units disembark first. Then:\n\n1. Pick 1 **BLOODLETTERS** unit of yours that is in Reserves.\n2. Set it up more than 6″ horizontally from every enemy unit and wholly within 9″ of the destroyed model.\n3. Remove the destroyed model.\n\nIt is limited to 1 use per battle round.",
